@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
### Gateway status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### Queue a moisture alert
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/telemetry/ingest
Content-Type: application/json

{"sensorId":"MS-01","payload":15}

### Live state
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/state

### Set pump ON
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/commands
Content-Type: application/json

{"sensorId":"PM-01","enabled":true}

### Restore previous pump state
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/commands/undo

### Disconnect an intermediate node
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/devices/TP-01/online
Content-Type: application/json

{"online":false}

### Recomputed route
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/topology?source=MS-01&target=GW-01

### Query all retained moisture readings
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/history/MS-01

### Reconnect the intermediate node
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/devices/TP-01/online
Content-Type: application/json

{"online":true}
